stateDiagram-v2
    %% Transition labels are tagged with the task that WRITES the state today:
    %%   [nfc]  = nfcTask (src/nfc_task.cpp)   — detect / read / classify / physical writes
    %%   [sync] = syncTask (src/sync_task.cpp) — WiFi / store / weigh / reconcile
    %% This split ownership of one gState global is the subject of
    %% state-machine-ownership.md: two writers, no arbiter. "idle*" below means
    %% idleState() picks Idle (joined) vs IdleNoWiFi (SoftAP) from gApSsid.

    [*] --> Boot

    Boot --> WiFiSetupMode: [sync] no saved creds -> portal opens
    Boot --> Idle: [sync] saved creds join immediately
    note right of Boot
        nfcTask does NOT poll the reader in Boot or
        WiFiSetupMode: polling the PN5180 while the
        SoftAP radio transmits hung it with the SPI
        bus held and froze the display (fix 9280424).
    end note

    WiFiSetupMode --> Idle: [sync] credentials accepted, joined
    WiFiSetupMode --> IdleNoWiFi: [sync] portal timeout -> SoftAP fallback

    Idle --> TagDetecting: [nfc] tag presence (1st read)
    IdleNoWiFi --> TagDetecting: [nfc] tag presence (1st read)
    IdleNoWiFi --> Idle: [sync] station WiFi comes up later

    TagDetecting --> Idle: [nfc] false trigger (idle*)
    TagDetecting --> TagReadError: [nfc] 3 reads, inconsistent/corrupt
    TagDetecting --> BlankTagFound: [nfc] 3 reads confirm, unformatted
    TagDetecting --> ValidTagFound: [nfc] 3 reads confirm, valid OPT

    TagReadError --> Idle: [nfc] tag removed (idle*)

    BlankTagFound --> AwaitingFormatConfirm: [nfc] prompt + 5s countdown
    note right of AwaitingFormatConfirm
        Confirm-by-inaction: live 5..4..3..2..1 countdown,
        LED blinks accelerating. Remove to cancel; leave
        in place to 0 to confirm.
    end note
    AwaitingFormatConfirm --> FormattingAndRegistering: [nfc] countdown 0, tag present
    AwaitingFormatConfirm --> Idle: [nfc] removed during countdown (idle*)
    FormattingAndRegistering --> ValidTagFound: [nfc] formatted (blank, nil UUID)

    ValidTagFound --> Present: [sync] blank -> mint UUID + stub record (needs onboarding)
    ValidTagFound --> ForeignTagFound: [sync] uuid not in local store (valid, unregistered)
    ValidTagFound --> WeighingAndSync: [sync] uuid matches a known spool

    ForeignTagFound --> RegisteringForeignTag: [sync] adopt product + create record from tag's Main
    RegisteringForeignTag --> WeighingAndSync: [sync] local record created
    ForeignTagFound --> Idle: [nfc] tag removed (idle*)
    RegisteringForeignTag --> Idle: [nfc] tag removed mid-registration (idle*)

    WeighingAndSync --> Present: [sync] weigh once; write tag Aux; append weigh event

    Present --> ReconcilingMainSection: [sync] 1s poll detects a local-store edit
    ReconcilingMainSection --> Present: [nfc] tag Main rewritten, snapshot updated
    Present --> Idle: [nfc] tag removed, 2 misses (idle*)
